 goes through the Italian-born matriarch's journey with one of India's most politically influential families. It has already garnered political controversy, with the ruling BJP accusing her of "whitewashing."</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Borussia Dortmund's Felix Nmecha and the question of religion</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e4577d8fa61c1a1ba1164e2a7ce8e92907914741801de39c68a695a11dd0c24e</id><updated>2026-11-10T16:30:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T11:12:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/borussia-dortmund-s-felix-nmecha-and-the-question-of-religion/a-79900432--cd7bb6e11389.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/borussia-dortmund-s-felix-nmecha-and-the-question-of-religion/a-79900432?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Felix Nmecha's "Crowns down" celebration has drawn criticism from a Borussia Dortmund fan club, reopening debate over faith, inclusion and religious messaging in football.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Spain: Police officer killed in Oviedo after neighborhood dispute escalates with explosion</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:38f57ab4405a67791fc078b4924c49faa4b7928747a9abba9aac852927179cb4</id><updated>2026-11-10T16:30:32Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T10:12:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/spain-police-officer-killed-in-oviedo-after-neighborhood-dispute-escalates-with-explosion/a-79907509--9062605e4d3a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/spain-police-officer-killed-in-oviedo-after-neighborhood-dispute-escalates-with-explosion/a-79907509?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">After security services responded to a shooting, a bomb found in a backpack nearby detonated before it could be defused.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Fact check: Online disinformation rife after Krakow mass shooting</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:07a8418f34232a600908487d3893df8ca347a64aa51fcbd94661fb654f71753e</id><updated>2026-11-10T16:30:35Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T10:02:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/fact-check-online-disinformation-rife-after-krakow-mass-shooting/a-79900620--80ad1afffb68.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/fact-check-online-disinformation-rife-after-krakow-mass-shooting/a-79900620?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Fake and AI-manipulated images spread online in the hours after the Krakow attack, fueling false narratives about the mass shooting. DW Fact Check examined what's real, and what isn't.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>DR Congo: 66 soldiers sentenced to death for 'cowardice' in conflict with FRN rebels</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7de9f3eafc2f881f031c9189edcbd76a8d44543cf41b614ead5713faab95bdd5</id><updated>2026-11-10T16:30:38Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T09:43:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/dr-congo-66-soldiers-sentenced-to-death-for-cowardice-in-conflict-with-frn-rebels/a-79906794--651090ee3cc2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/dr-congo-66-soldiers-sentenced-to-death-for-cowardice-in-conflict-with-frn-rebels/a-79906794?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Dozens of defendants were put on trial over accusations that they abandoned their posts and refused to follow direct orders.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Ilse Aigner meets parties at Bundestag</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:304a6a15f5af973e6b14d19f2a6ba3ca00c21bc0163811eb7e7d9f2afd75353f</id><updated>2026-11-10T16:30:41Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T08:36:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-ilse-aigner-meets-parties-at-bundestag/live-79906440--d4a05b14149e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-ilse-aigner-meets-parties-at-bundestag/live-79906440?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The presidential candidate put forward by the conservative bloc has said she wouldn't meet with the far-right AfD. Meanwhile, Chancellor Merz is set to host Hungarian Prime Minister Magyar. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Why electrification is the climate game changer we need</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c594399a6206ce1a52911411efa8e12eaf3be16b58cec748f34965287c557cd5</id><updated>2026-11-10T16:30:44Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T08:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/why-electrification-is-the-climate-game-changer-we-need/a-79615979--0dbca6445640.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/why-electrification-is-the-climate-game-changer-we-need/a-79615979?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">From EVs and electric buses on the road, heat pumps warming homes and solar panels powering appliances, the shift to electrifying tech is already in full swing. But what exactly does "electrification" mean?</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Will Australia push for fossil fuel exit at UN talks?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:79135aa9ceab163b809c6e9a726d61253028552654beef8acf59344005bada68</id><updated>2026-11-10T16:30:47Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T07:43:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/will-australia-push-for-fossil-fuel-exit-at-un-talks/a-79782066--e866c53d355a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/will-australia-push-for-fossil-fuel-exit-at-un-talks/a-79782066?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The heat is on Australia as chief negotiator at the COP31 UN climate conference to forge a path away from coal and gas, and to protect Pacific neighbors facing rising sea levels.</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>US, Russia and Ukraine start talks in Abu Dhabi</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:cf6248b287a85a13b3a002610149b6f5c7bf27079272ee8e782d17272bba6f59</id><updated>2026-11-10T16:30:50Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T07:09:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-russia-and-ukraine-start-talks-in-abu-dhabi/live-79906232--1798827a3411.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-russia-and-ukraine-start-talks-in-abu-dhabi/live-79906232?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Peace talks between Russia, Ukraine and the US are getting underway in the United Arab Emirates. It is the first such meeting since February. DW has the latest updates.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>India news: New Delhi ready to mediate Black Sea food corridors, says Ukraine's Zelenskyy</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f77af9af893542b42ca3bc5bec0ae83bd20d488ad6b3c6793565bd5701cb8d2e</id><updated>2026-11-10T16:29:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T06:52:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-new-delhi-ready-to-mediate-black-sea-food-corridors-says-ukraine-s-zelenskyy/live-79906023--cfcf53dfd0a6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-new-delhi-ready-to-mediate-black-sea-food-corridors-says-ukraine-s-zelenskyy/live-79906023?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Ukraine's President Volodymyr Zelenskyy said he discussed establishing "food corridors" in the Black Sea in a phone call with Indian Prime Minister Narendra Modi.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Why malnutrition can go unnoticed, and what that means for our health</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f8f3a70d348d26e6d96222a82491f12fe33fae47bb914997d9c7a8ea978379e6</id><updated>2026-11-10T16:29:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T05:48:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/why-malnutrition-can-go-unnoticed-and-what-that-means-for-our-health/a-79871016--a7247c0af1e5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/why-malnutrition-can-go-unnoticed-and-what-that-means-for-our-health/a-79871016?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">More than 2 billion people worldwide suffer from nutrient deficiencies, most of them in the Global South. The health consequences can be devastating.</summary><category term="Science" /></entry><entry><title>Australia to introduce mandatory AI safeguards</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f579515f8522b8e995e2af1858f70be03f778f4e012683ac7a66b64e9f736ecf</id><updated>2026-11-10T16:29:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T04:55:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/australia-to-introduce-mandatory-ai-safeguards/a-79906006--f7d003a54254.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/australia-to-introduce-mandatory-ai-safeguards/a-79906006?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Australian government's decision to establish an AI safety regulator comes after an OpenAI agent accessed a government medical statistics portal without authorization.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Iran war oil shock drives dip in global emissions, study shows</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b6f6b03e2fbae5ba3209dad8abb1714e921c69013db16847a2e0014612cc16f9</id><updated>2026-11-10T16:29:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T03:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/iran-war-oil-shock-drives-dip-in-global-emissions-study-shows/a-79905937--fec20d5dba18.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/iran-war-oil-shock-drives-dip-in-global-emissions-study-shows/a-79905937?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Global carbon emissions are expected to fall slightly in 2026, but not because of major progress on climate action. Instead, it's high energy prices following the US attack on Iran that's driving the trend.</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry></feed>
